# Lanterel Host's error reports (src/mainErrors.ts) go to the project its
# Lanterel server names (GET /api/error-tracking). These, built in by
# `npm run build`, override it: for a dev build with its own project.
# Leave them out to use the server's; the same project key as web/.env.
# VITE_POSTHOG_KEY=phc_your_project_token
# VITE_POSTHOG_HOST=https://eu.i.posthog.com
